{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“那次决定曾把他从犹疑里带出来”承接了 S04-1 已写明的行动效果，没有新增前史或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“不用时时防备的亲近”仍是抽象的情感对象，没有把珠子里的双手、夜色或低语写成真实人物和场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"本条写的是他如何把难受解释成不够坚定并压抑疲惫，没有新增具体往事、对白或外部行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“逼着一个已经累了的人硬撑”是对自我苛责的比喻，没有把疲惫的人写成另一个真实人物。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“不必防备的生活”仍是抽象的依恋对象，没有具体指认某个故乡、人物或过去场景，也没有把音乐变化直接当成心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-1 已说明那一步曾让他重新动起来并使他愿意坚持，直接支撑他如今舍不得放手。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-2 已写明那份亲近带来的温暖和不舍，足以解释他想到亲近时心软，而不能停的部分另有眼前任务支撑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-4 说明眼前的事催他继续行动，却没有直接解释他为何把难受误判为不够坚定、又为何觉得承认受不了就是辜负决定。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从不肯放手、压抑疲惫，到把坚持变成苛责，最后逐渐松劲并承认依恋的连续变化。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R18\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“怕失望说明变心”这一具体心理判断没有保留；修补后改成“怕松手就辜负当初认真”，表达的是害怕背弃初衷，并未明确保留他把失望视为变心证据的想法。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S05-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“惦记亲近、心里软下来、眼前的事又让他不能停”把几层意思串在一条里，其中亲近带来的温暖和眼前任务的催促已在 S04-2、S04-4 及更早条目反复出现，本条新增的信息偏少。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S05-3\",\n        \"S05-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"两条都写了压下疲惫、不准承认受不了并继续硬撑，S05-4 虽新增了发现自己正在逼迫自己的转折，但前半与 S05-3 重复，可以让前者更集中于自我苛责的形成、后者更集中于意识到这种苛责。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c469defb-51cd-4731-b698-c604843466df", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100637344922Z", "elapsed_seconds": 514.968, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:15:12.332016+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ccdb2d3ea74f639503ebd18e43e1c46414e368cfae034eb1d299ae3c5efad43d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100637344922Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "38cc750dcd61243eeb938eff37ea271e7a7660e62260c20ee4920b257833137e"}}}
